    {"@context":"https:\/\/schema.org","@type":"Recipe","url":"https:\/\/www.tasteline.com\/recept\/fattoush-med-grillad-lax\/","name":"Fattoush med grillad lax","image":"https:\/\/eu-central-1.linodeobjects.com\/tasteline\/2018\/05\/fattoush-med-grillad-lax.jpg","datePublished":"2018-05-31","totalTime":"","recipeYield":"4 portioner","description":"och V\u00e4sterbottensost","recipeCategory":"Mat","keywords":"varmr\u00e4tt","nutrition":{"@type":"NutritionInformation"},"recipeIngredient":["laxfil\u00e9(er)","gurka","vin\u00e4ger","olivolja","tomat","sumac","v\u00e4sterbottensost","citronskal","mach\u00e9sallad","pressad citron","paprikakrydda","R\u00f6dl\u00f6k","salt","cayennepeppar","r\u00e4disor","svartpeppar","chiliflakes","Sparris","granat\u00e4pple(n)","persilja","Libabr\u00f6d"],"recipeInstructions":["R\u00f6r ihop kryddorna med olivolja och gnid in laxen, l\u00e5t vila en stund f\u00f6r att smakerna ska dra in. Halvera citronen.\n\n","Sk\u00e4r br\u00f6det i mindre bitar och v\u00e4rm oljan i en stekpanna. L\u00e4gg ned br\u00f6det och fr\u00e4s gyllenbruna, lyft ur och l\u00e5t torka p\u00e5 hush\u00e5llspapper.","Blanda ingredienserna i en sk\u00e5l och ringla sedan \u00f6ver salladen.","Pensla laxen med olja och grilla med skinnsidan mot gallret 30\u201340 minuter p\u00e5 indirekt v\u00e4rme under lock. Anv\u00e4nd g\u00e4rna fiskgaller.","Blanda gurka, tomater, mach\u00e9sallad, r\u00f6dl\u00f6k, r\u00e4disor, sparris, granat\u00e4pple och persilja i en sk\u00e5l. R\u00f6r ned de rostade krutongerna och gener\u00f6st med V\u00e4sterbottensost."],"aggregateRating":{"@type":"AggregateRating","ratingValue":4.67,"ratingCount":6},"recipeCuisine":"Libanon"}
